{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/9933593c40245402e1b48ec3b1c3fb58.avif?t=1758204522\" width=780 height=155 /></span>Lead humanity\u2019s fight for survival in Mordfield Command by working to outmaneuver Algorithm Alpha \u2014 an AI war machine that has turned against its makers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fusion of 4X strategy, turn-based tactics, and wave-defense survival, every choice determines your fate. You\u2019ll fortify strongholds, manage scarce contested resources, and strike back against a relentless enemy who holds the advantage from day one. A unique action point system adds another layer of strategy, letting you to perform extra moves and abilities at the cost of precious resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mordfield offers a single player campaign, several challenge missions, PvE skirmish, co-op and  PvP, providing players multiple ways to test their strategic leadership. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple: reclaim control, or be erased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/badb50b59b8b509732c8b67fc6dbbe37.poster.avif?t=1758204522\" width=780 height=437 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/badb50b59b8b509732c8b67fc6dbbe37.webm?t=1758204522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy grows stronger with every passing day. To survive, you\u2019ll need more than walls\u2014you\u2019ll need to adapt on the fly, reassess your tactics, and expand your command posts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy reinforcements spawn at regular intervals, and only by striking back decisively and keeping pace with the escalating onslaught can you hope to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/fec76b1b45e620b1cf0dca42ecb98e6b.poster.avif?t=1758204522\" width=780 height=437 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/fec76b1b45e620b1cf0dca42ecb98e6b.webm?t=1758204522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are scarce \u2014 and every scrap is contested. Reclaim vital resources to expand your reach and fuel your war effort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evolving tech tree unlocks powerful defenses and devastating countermeasures, giving you the edge in a war of attrition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strike back by targeting enemy outposts \u2014 shut down their reinforcements before they overwhelm you, and seize control of the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/3ae1052f91741cda9985bd993c3bea9d.poster.avif?t=1758204522\" width=780 height=433 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/3ae1052f91741cda9985bd993c3bea9d.webm?t=1758204522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the bold and fearless stand to defy our systematic annihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/a84e179d2f989eb3db96c79dec0c0ef9.avif?t=1758204522\" width=780 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timed Rounds</strong> \u2014 Enable an optional 15 or 30 second turn time and make critical decisions under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Point Economy</strong> \u2014 Allocate action points at the expense of finite resources in order to maximize your tactical options each turn. Every choice can make the difference between survival and annihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Technology Tree \u2014</strong>\u00a0Unlock new unit abilities, tactical tools, and economic upgrades as you progress through multiple tiers of research. Each tier offers meaningful upgrades to allow players to refine their strategy and adapt to new battlefield challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Map Editor</strong> \u2014 Create your own battlefields and unique missions with an in-game map editor. Share your creations with the community and test different strategies on other player made creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP Multiplayer</strong> \u2014 Challenge friends in tactical 1v1 combat. Play on custom maps, change round lengths, and assert your dominance in head to head game-play.\u00a0 Play on procedurally generated or player-made maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Map Generation</strong> \u2014 Each play unfolds on a unique battlefield. No two playthroughs are alike, keeping games fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Terrain</strong> \u2014 Battlefields respond to combat and will become damaged over time. Damaged areas are harder to traverse, forcing players to adapt there strategy at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Unit Experience</strong> \u2014 Some units can grow stronger over time. Deploying and maneuvering squads carefully will allow players to create elite fighters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unmatched Replayability</strong> \u2014 Multiple resources, diverse combat units, varied terrain, and an expanding technology tree combine with procedural generation to ensure new challenges every time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2948470?t=1758204522","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2948470?t=1758204522","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/7ca5f3432a32a969a0c329285f62aa2bc3601fce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758204522","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/7ca5f3432a32a969a0c329285f62aa2bc3601fce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758204522","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3495190,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/9933593c40245402e1b48ec3b1c3fb58.avif?t=1758204522\" width=780 height=155 /></span>Lead humanity\u2019s fight for survival in Mordfield Command by working to outmaneuver Algorithm Alpha \u2014 an AI war machine that has turned against its makers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fusion of 4X strategy, turn-based tactics, and wave-defense survival, every choice determines your fate. You\u2019ll fortify strongholds, manage scarce contested resources, and strike back against a relentless enemy who holds the advantage from day one. A unique action point system adds another layer of strategy, letting you to perform extra moves and abilities at the cost of precious resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mordfield offers a single player campaign, several challenge missions, PvE skirmish, co-op and  PvP, providing players multiple ways to test their strategic leadership. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple: reclaim control, or be erased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/badb50b59b8b509732c8b67fc6dbbe37.poster.avif?t=1758204522\" width=780 height=437 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/badb50b59b8b509732c8b67fc6dbbe37.webm?t=1758204522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy grows stronger with every passing day. To survive, you\u2019ll need more than walls\u2014you\u2019ll need to adapt on the fly, reassess your tactics, and expand your command posts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy reinforcements spawn at regular intervals, and only by striking back decisively and keeping pace with the escalating onslaught can you hope to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/fec76b1b45e620b1cf0dca42ecb98e6b.poster.avif?t=1758204522\" width=780 height=437 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/fec76b1b45e620b1cf0dca42ecb98e6b.webm?t=1758204522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are scarce \u2014 and every scrap is contested. Reclaim vital resources to expand your reach and fuel your war effort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evolving tech tree unlocks powerful defenses and devastating countermeasures, giving you the edge in a war of attrition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strike back by targeting enemy outposts \u2014 shut down their reinforcements before they overwhelm you, and seize control of the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/3ae1052f91741cda9985bd993c3bea9d.poster.avif?t=1758204522\" width=780 height=433 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/3ae1052f91741cda9985bd993c3bea9d.webm?t=1758204522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the bold and fearless stand to defy our systematic annihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/a84e179d2f989eb3db96c79dec0c0ef9.avif?t=1758204522\" width=780 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timed Rounds</strong> \u2014 Enable an optional 15 or 30 second turn time and make critical decisions under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Point Economy</strong> \u2014 Allocate action points at the expense of finite resources in order to maximize your tactical options each turn. Every choice can make the difference between survival and annihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Technology Tree \u2014</strong>\u00a0Unlock new unit abilities, tactical tools, and economic upgrades as you progress through multiple tiers of research. Each tier offers meaningful upgrades to allow players to refine their strategy and adapt to new battlefield challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Map Editor</strong> \u2014 Create your own battlefields and unique missions with an in-game map editor. Share your creations with the community and test different strategies on other player made creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP Multiplayer</strong> \u2014 Challenge friends in tactical 1v1 combat. Play on custom maps, change round lengths, and assert your dominance in head to head game-play.\u00a0 Play on procedurally generated or player-made maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Map Generation</strong> \u2014 Each play unfolds on a unique battlefield. No two playthroughs are alike, keeping games fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Terrain</strong> \u2014 Battlefields respond to combat and will become damaged over time. Damaged areas are harder to traverse, forcing players to adapt there strategy at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Unit Experience</strong> \u2014 Some units can grow stronger over time. Deploying and maneuvering squads carefully will allow players to create elite fighters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unmatched Replayability</strong> \u2014 Multiple resources, diverse combat units, varied terrain, and an expanding technology tree combine with procedural generation to ensure new challenges every time.</p>","developers":["Software Verde, LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/8379af69a381e3e5cfc26b5d72173d365d06fea4/header.jpg?t=1758204522","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5, 3rd gen (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<